Package: bodycon
Title: Estimation of Animal Body Condition Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Julia", "Riley", , "jriley@mta.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7691-6910")),
    person("Fonti", "Kar", role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2760-3974"))
    )
Description: Provides functions for calculating and visualizing body condition indices for animals. Methods include residual-based ordinary least squares (OLS) indices, scaled mass index (SMI) using OLS and robust regression, and visualizations to compare and contrast the appropriateness of these indices.
